  "prefLabel": "Site 103.05 Counsel for the Public",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 103.05 Counsel for the Public. Pursuant to RSA 162-H:9, the attorney general shall appoint an assistant attorney general as counsel for the public in seeking to protect the quality of the environment and in seeking to assure an adequate supply of energy.\n\nSource. #9182, eff 6-17-08, ss by #10993, eff 12-16-15 (formerly Site 103.06)",
